    ["EN-REA-022","english","Reading","3","วิเคราะห์","G-EN-006","","Which sentence best summarises the passage?","Photography encouraged painters to try new ideas.","Portraits are better than photographs.","Cameras were always cheap.","Photography destroyed painting.","","A","ประโยคสุดท้าย: \"photography actually pushed painting in new directions\"","ถูกต้อง","ผู้เขียนไม่ได้ตัดสิน","บทอ่านบอกว่าภายหลังจึงถูกลง","ขัดกับคำว่า Instead และประโยคสุดท้าย","คำว่า Instead / actually มักนำความจริงที่ขัดกับความคาดหมาย","","","active","original"],
    ["EN-REA-023","english","Reading","1","จำ","G-EN-007","Dear Students,\nThe Art Department is pleased to announce the Young Designers Workshop, which will take place on Saturday 14 December from 9:00 to 15:00 in the Library Hall. A professional graphic designer will teach basic logo design and how to use free design software. The workshop is free, but places are limited to 30 students. To join, please fill in the form at the art office by Friday 6 December. Students must bring their own laptop or tablet. Lunch will be provided. Students who complete the workshop will receive a certificate.\nMs. Pranee, Head of Art","Where will the workshop take place?","online","at a design company","in the art office","in the Library Hall","","D","\"in the Library Hall\"","ไม่ใช่ออนไลน์","ไม่มีในประกาศ","ห้องศิลปะเป็นที่ส่งใบสมัคร","ถูกต้อง","ข้อถามสถานที่ หาคำบุพบท in / at","","","active","original"],
